        "section": "atomiccommit",
        "source_id": "sqlite-3.53.4-docs",
        "start": 1105,
        "text": "SQLite still supports atomic commit when write-ahead logging is enabled, but it accomplishes atomic commit by a different mechanism from the one described in this article.",
        "title": "atomiccommit"
      },
